<title>JAPAN: Daihyaku Mutual needs more time to cut bad loans.</title>
<headline>Daihyaku Mutual needs more time to cut bad loans.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daihyaku Mutual Life Insurance Co said on Thursday it would take at least two to three more years to bring down the amount of its bad loans to a manageable level.</p>
<p>The statement was made as the firm announced its results for the first half of 1996/97 business year.</p>
